    "description": {
      "value": "<div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--2\"><p><em>護甲（中甲），珍稀（需同調）</em><br />這套奇形怪狀的黑白色調護甲鑄成於 <strong>墮影冥界Shadowfell</strong> 之中，它充滿着那個可怕位面的幽影能量。<br />穿着這套護甲期間，你爲防止陷入或結束 <strong>恐慌Frightened</strong> 狀態所做的豁免具有優勢。<br />這套護甲具有3發充能。你可以消耗一發充能以用其施展法術<em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack-zh-tw.new-icon.Item.6MYwBtZurc8Zw1ac]{安定心神 Calm Emotions}</em>（豁免DC15）。這套護甲在每日黎明時分恢復[[/r 1d3]]發已消耗的充能數。</p><p><span style=\"font-family:'Roboto Condensed', sans-serif\">該護甲主要由皮條固定的金屬護胸組成。儘管它並沒有爲四肢提供額外的防護，但其在保證着裝者活動自由度的同時，爲其生命器官提供了十分有效的保護效果。</span></p><p>This intricate grayscale armor was forged in the Shadowfell and is infused with that plane's gloom.</p><p>While you're wearing this armor, you have advantage on saving throws you make to avoid or end the frightened condition on yourself.</p><p>This armor has 3 charges. You can expend a charge to cast the @spell[Calm Emotions] spell (save DC <span class=\"rd__dc\">15</span>) from the armor. This armor regains [[/r 1d3]] expended charges daily at dawn.</p><p>This armor consists of a fitted metal chest piece worn with supple leather. Although it leaves the legs and arms relatively unprotected, this armor provides good protection for the wearer's vital organs while leaving the wearer relatively unencumbered.</p></div>",
      "chat": ""
    },
